  "details": "I've been thinking it'd be super cool if we could somehow access some game data a bit more smoothly, you know? No pressure, but I've got a wish list:\n\n*---------------------------*\n\n* VRChat avatar head POSITION\n\n* VRChat avatar head ROTATION\n\n*---------------------------* EXTREMELY USEFUL\n\n* Pickup Hover (0 - NO HOVER | 1 - HOVER)\n\n* Pickup Grabbed State (0 - NO ITEM | 1 - ITEM HELD)\n\n* Interactable Hover (0 - NO HOVER | 1 - HOVER)\n\n* Interactable Clicked\n\n* Station Hover (0 - NO HOVER | 1 - HOVER)\n\n* Station Seated (0 - NOT SEATED | 1 - SEATED)\n\n*---------------------------* USEFUL\n\nIn general having this information accessible, would make my software and many others have way more accurate data and on point without resorting to not so accurate/annoying methods to obtain said information in a timely and or accurate matter, perhaps have it outputted to OSC if possible?",
